### AnnamSetu API examples (VS Code "REST Client" or JetBrains HTTP client).
### Start the app first:  .venv\Scripts\python -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload
### The full, always-current list is at http://localhost:8000/docs (APP_DOCS=true).

@base = http://localhost:8000

### Liveness + database check (public)
GET {{base}}/api/health

### 1. Get a CSRF token (also sets the XSRF-TOKEN cookie). Copy csrfToken into @csrf below.
GET {{base}}/api/auth/csrf

@csrf = paste-the-token-here

### 2. Log in (form fields). Use a demo user from README.md. Login issues a NEW token:
###    copy the csrfToken from this response into @csrf again.
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

username=kitchen&password=your-demo-password

### 3. Who am I? (role, kitchen/NGO, sampleData, serverNow)
GET {{base}}/api/me

### 4. Demo clock (ADMIN, demo mode only): read
GET {{base}}/api/admin/demo/clock

### Demo clock: set a time (no offset = IST)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/demo/clock
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"at": "2026-10-30T11:55:00"}

### Demo clock: jump forward 15 minutes
POST {{base}}/api/admin/demo/clock
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"plusMinutes": 15}

### Demo clock: back to real time
DELETE {{base}}/api/admin/demo/clock
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

### Demo reset: truncate transactional tables, reseed today, clock to 08:30
POST {{base}}/api/admin/demo/reset
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

### ---------------- Phase 2: PREDICT + PREVENT (log in as `kitchen` first) ----------------

### Kitchen setup: slots (+ kitchen info and the NGOs that can be a standing partner)
GET {{base}}/api/kitchen/slots

### Edit a slot (times, cutoff, ratio 0-1, buffer %, share at T-90, partner, pickup offset, rescue)
PUT {{base}}/api/kitchen/slots/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"serviceStart": "12:00", "serviceEnd": "14:00", "optoutCutoffMin": 180, "attendanceRatio": 0.85, "bufferPct": 6.0,
 "shareArrivedByT90": 0.4, "standingNgoId": 1, "pickupOffsetMin": 15, "rescueEnabled": true}

### Dishes: list / add / edit
GET {{base}}/api/kitchen/dishes

###
POST {{base}}/api/kitchen/dishes
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"name": "Curd rice", "nameTa": "தயிர் சாதம்", "isVeg": true, "cookedGPerDiner": 180, "rawGPerDiner": 60, "costPerKgInr": 50}

### Meals of a date (default: today on the server clock)
GET {{base}}/api/kitchen/meals?date=2026-10-30

### Plan a meal from its slot: exactly one (veg) reserve dish; usualG = the usual cooked grams
POST {{base}}/api/kitchen/meals
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"slotId": 1, "date": "2026-10-31", "registeredCount": 1000, "extraOptOuts": 0,
 "dishes": [{"dishId": 1, "isReserve": true, "usualG": 185000}, {"dishId": 2, "usualG": 135000}, {"dishId": 3}]}

### Full meal view: live P50/P90 while PLANNED, cook card, T-90 numbers, serverNow
GET {{base}}/api/kitchen/meals/1

### Override (PLANNED only): P90 >= P50 and a reason
POST {{base}}/api/kitchen/meals/1/override
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"p50": 900, "p90": 960, "reason": "Hostel day: guests expected"}

### Issue the cook card: freezes the numbers (the scheduler does it at the cutoff otherwise)
POST {{base}}/api/kitchen/meals/1/issue-cook-card
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

### Door tally (ISSUED / IN_SERVICE): {"count": n} or {"delta": +1 / +10 / -1}
POST {{base}}/api/kitchen/meals/1/live-count
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"delta": 10}

### Public (no login, CSRF token only): meals still open for opt-out at MESS1
GET {{base}}/api/public/kitchens/MESS1/open-meals

### Opt out (the hostel ID goes in the body, never in the URL); repeat = harmless, and the answer never
### says whether this ID had opted out already (privacy)
POST {{base}}/api/public/opt-outs
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"kitchenCode": "MESS1", "date": "2026-10-30", "slot": "LUNCH", "hostelId": "SAMPLE-STUDENT-1"}

### Undo before the cutoff
POST {{base}}/api/public/opt-outs/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"kitchenCode": "MESS1", "date": "2026-10-30", "slot": "LUNCH", "hostelId": "SAMPLE-STUDENT-1"}

### 5. Log out (issues a new session; get a new CSRF token afterwards)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
